@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@viewerToken = paste-viewer-access-token
@friendToken = paste-friend-access-token
@feedDate = 2026-08-23
@unfinishedTaskId = paste-shared-unfinished-task-guid
@completedPostId = paste-completed-post-guid
@proofPostId = paste-proof-post-guid

### Feed page for a date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed?date={{feedDate}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Search the selected date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed?date={{feedDate}}&search=work&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Unfinished feed-item details (activityType 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/items/{{unfinishedTaskId}}?activityType=1&date={{feedDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Completed post details (activityType 2 or 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/items/{{completedPostId}}?activityType=2&date={{feedDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Mark a proof as viewed; repeat safely to verify idempotency
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/{{proofPostId}}/view-proof
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Legacy completed-post route retained for compatibility
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/{{completedPostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Accept: application/json
